# Network endpoints are configuration. Nothing in this file is a protocol
# constant, and the package refuses to start without these three variables.
#
# The endpoints below were reachable on 2026-08-30. They are documentation,
# not defaults: the code has no built-in network list.
#
# mainnet   — moves real funds. Human decision, every time.
#   TEZOS_NETWORK=mainnet
#   TEZOS_RPC_URL=https://rpc.tzbeta.net
#   TZKT_API_URL=https://api.tzkt.io
#
# Shadownet — the Tezzet testnet (application side).
#   TEZOS_NETWORK=shadownet
#   TEZOS_RPC_URL=https://rpc.shadownet.teztnets.com
#   TZKT_API_URL=https://api.shadownet.tzkt.io
#
# Bakingnet — the TAPS testnet (baker side). The Shadownet registration asks
# that bakers not be tested there, which is why the two products differ.
#   TEZOS_NETWORK=bakingnet
#   TEZOS_RPC_URL=https://rpc.bakingnet.teztnets.com
#   TZKT_API_URL=https://api.bakingnet.tzkt.io
#
# Ghostnet does not exist — it is absent from https://teztnets.com/teztnets.json.

TEZOS_NETWORK=
TEZOS_RPC_URL=
TZKT_API_URL=
